
---

## 三、`.gitignore`（项目根目录）

```gitignore
# ============ Python ============
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# ============ Node ============
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# ============ 前端构建产物 ============
frontend/dist/
frontend/.vite/

# ============ Electron ============
electron/dist/
electron/out/
release/

# ============ PyInstaller ============
build/build/
build/dist/
*.spec.bak

# ============ 数据库 & 日志 ============
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db.backup
data/
logs/
*.log

# ============ 调试文件 ============
collector/debug/
*.bak
*.tmp

# ============ IDE ============
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# ============ 操作系统 ============
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

.env
backend/.env

# 调试脚本
collector/debug_*.py
collector/parse_test.py

# 旧 MySQL 脚本（已迁移到 SQLite）
database/